{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1000_p", "source_sha256": "356bf2df20c04b65543eb5c6df8046db4555060bc10b8b51be7075abb08bc7f2", "ja": "（遊園地の撮影は、無事に終わった。時間があるので、\n百合子のリクエストでアトラクションに乗る事にした）", "zh": "（游乐园的拍摄行程顺利结束了。由于还有时间，\n我决定听从百合子的请求，带她去搭游乐设施。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "f260288bfac0f9245760f23db259f511c75861bf089fce391affee5a71c48a4a", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\n今度は、あのジェットコースターに乗りませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n接下来要不要搭那个云霄飞车？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1002_p", "source_sha256": "69f223d08c9db2932e6663c589de44655b5a9455f986a4f42a02be5e0a0245aa", "ja": "百合子、今日はずいぶん元気なんだな。\n撮影の後なのに、疲れてないのか？", "zh": "百合子，你今天特别有活力呢。\n明明才刚结束摄影，你不累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "cb3694b83aab7d1179427f5286624096b6a15058ee22817b1db038b6a41e753b", "ja": "そう言う{$P$}さんは……\nもしかして、疲れてますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生这么说……\n是表示你累了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6103a4829c8934bfd43944f455165230bf4bccdd0a7436f7052b9fce33f5c32e", "ja": "いや、まだ大丈夫だけど……\nこう立て続けに乗って、百合子はキツくないのか？", "zh": "不，我还好……\n但这样一个接一个玩，百合子不会难受吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "e064db8f0dbb840b9f407bd5a317491bac03fc5e252c8760c17b4bcf5188135d", "ja": "私は大丈夫です！　むしろ、こういう機会に\n耐性をつけておかないと、と思って……！", "zh": "我没问题的！我反而觉得自己\n得藉这种机会产生抗体才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ff60d3518af70c8729093195f2d43a967fbd48f44a3bd24a1fb44380a60b0087", "ja": "こういう機会？", "zh": "这种机会？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "a348be4e352b9d4ef6d6972f322dae9469700bff668ee8690525d6e8e702592f", "ja": "はい！　いつもは怖くて乗れないアトラクションも、\n{$P$}さんが一緒なら……あっ！？", "zh": "没错！就算是平常怕得不敢搭的游乐设施，\n只要和{$P$}先生一起就……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "ad13f09b11f1b69c9f4a7c0ec913703a58700109dddc0648eb794eb9bc1e82e9", "ja": "い、今のはウソ……じゃないですけど、ナシです！\n私の心の声なので、聞かなかったことにしてください！", "zh": "刚、刚刚那些是骗你的……才怪，但请当我没说！\n请你当作没听到我的心声！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6cf5ff0d0e52ac1df80a847444de42858856ee52293f860eeb017673e4a66a1a", "ja": "そうか……百合子、本当は\n激しいアトラクションが苦手なんだな？", "zh": "这样啊……百合子，你其实\n很讨厌那种激烈的游乐设施对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "45867b75b62ead72ade256bced5dbcb14b908c455a778594b06e4bccc665528b", "ja": "に、苦手というほどではないんですけど。\n怖くて乗ったことがないものとか、あったりして……。", "zh": "也、也没到讨厌这个份上。\n就是会怕，所以不太敢去搭而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1011_p", "source_sha256": "f3884e7e1a7c86d57058523e800b0d2807e4c967d9b70a9714f885250aa395e4", "ja": "なるほど……\n食わず嫌いならぬ、乗らず嫌いというところかな。", "zh": "原来如此……\n你是不想没尝试过就妄下评论吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "3f3aa44ed14b321c27ec91729dea264ef056eb1d980429c7fafc29f4c06b2757", "ja": "でも、さっきのライドは、すごく楽しかったので！\n乗らず嫌いなんて、損だと思うんです！", "zh": "不过，刚才那个飞天椅好好玩喔！\n要是没搭过就讨厌也太吃亏了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "d63ed02214b2b16101060e582191a75c0ea04f5da3af86039f9eb9f198baadd6", "ja": "だから……{$P$}さん！\n私と一緒に、アトラクションに乗ってくれませんか？", "zh": "所以……{$P$}先生！\n你愿意陪我一起去搭游乐设施吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1014_p", "source_sha256": "aba4b89dd726f46d7bf5ea65308f1041b442601eafe096aa10ba59c67b5e6019", "ja": "うーん、そうだな。\n百合子が無理をしないなら、乗ってもいいけど。", "zh": "嗯……这个嘛，\n如果百合子没有在勉强自己，那就搭吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "6b7c1919cbc057235fa73f7b70d38b8b88c8cc6da5eafbb04e9c12e7740c0acd", "ja": "本当ですか！？　ありがとうございます！\nこれで私の人生に、楽しみがひとつ増えますね♪", "zh": "真的吗！？谢谢你！\n这样我的人生又增加一个乐趣了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9c565248e22d9ae66ada740717bfde7c8313913b432df73152315f22db760d29", "ja": "そんな大げさな事でもないと思うけど……その代わり、\n気分が悪くなったら言うんだぞ。無理は禁物だからな！", "zh": "我想是没有这么夸张……不过，\n你如果觉得不舒服要马上说喔，绝对不能勉强自己！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "554474fd0bcf2bfe062fc8966c856638d191d6e42e5346541d56a279e7d8ced6", "ja": "はい、わかりました！", "zh": "好，我明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0093_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0093_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "2b479fc7d3afb52e3e420d681527cd0a02ccf6091c1b473dcd164d802cbb5872", "ja": "それじゃ、次はあっちのコースターですね！\n{$P$}さん、行きましょう♪", "zh": "那接下来，去搭那边的云霄飞车！\n{$P$}先生，我们走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
